/*
  SoftwareUpdateHistoryWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0091 · SoftwareUpdateHistoryWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  SoftwareUpdateHistoryWidget resolves (table "SoftwareUpdateHistoryWidget") lives
  here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the
  app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact key set extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/SoftwareUpdateHistoryWidget.tsx). The remaining keys
  back the native-only chrome (per-status labels, freshness chip, refresh/retry/
  empty/error copy, relative-time phrasing, accessibility).
*/

